<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Email Address Changed - Task Days</title>
    <style>
      /* Reset styles for email clients */
      body, table, td, p, a, li, blockquote {
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }
      table, td {
        mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
        mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
      }
      img {
        -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
        border: 0;
        height: auto;
        line-height: 100%;
        outline: none;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      
      /* Import handwritten font */
      @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gloria+Hallelujah&display=swap');
      
      /* Main styles */
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        width: 100% !important;
        min-width: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f9ff 0%, #e0f2fe 100%);
        font-family: 'Gloria Hallelujah', 'Comic Sans MS', 'Marker Felt', 'Trebuchet MS', cursive, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #1f2937;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      
      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.3);
      }
      
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fd7e14 0%, #e83e8c 100%);
        padding: 40px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
      }
      
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }
      
      .header p {
        margin: 10px 0 0 0;
        font-size: 18px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
      
      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
      
      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #333333;
      }
      
      .message {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        color: #555555;
      }
      
      .change-info {
        background-color: #fff3cd;
        border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      
      .change-info h3 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #856404;
        font-size: 18px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      
      .change-info h3::before {
        content: "📧";
        margin-right: 10px;
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      
      .change-details {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #fd7e14;
      }
      
      .change-details h3 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #333333;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      
      .change-details p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #666666;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      .email-comparison {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      
      .old-email, .new-email {
        flex: 1;
        text-align: center;
      }
      
      .old-email {
        color: #dc3545;
        text-decoration: line-through;
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
      
      .new-email {
        color: #28a745;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      
      .arrow {
        font-size: 24px;
        color: #6c757d;
        margin: 0 20px;
      }
      
      .action-required {
        background-color: #f8d7da;
        border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      
      .action-required h3 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #721c24;
        font-size: 16px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      
      .action-required h3::before {
        content: "⚠️";
        margin-right: 10px;
        font-size: 18px;
      }
      
      .action-required p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #721c24;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      .footer {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      }
      
      .footer p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #666666;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      .footer a {
        color: #fd7e14;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      
      .footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      
      .support-info {
        background-color: #e3f2fd;
        border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      }
      
      .support-info h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #1976d2;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      
      .support-info p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #555555;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      /* Mobile responsiveness */
      @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .email-container {
          margin: 0;
          border-radius: 0;
        }
        
        .header, .content, .footer {
          padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
          font-size: 28px;
        }
        
        .email-comparison {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
        
        .arrow {
          transform: rotate(90deg);
          margin: 10px 0;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header">
        <h1>📧 Email Changed</h1>
        <p>Account update notification for <%= @app_name %></p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">
          Hi there,
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
          <p>We're writing to let you know that the email address for your <%= @app_name %> account has been changed.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Change Info -->
        <div class="change-info">
          <h2>Email Address Change</h2>
          <p>This email was sent to your old email address to notify you of the change. Future emails will be sent to your new email address.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Change Details -->
        <div class="change-details">
          <h3>Change Details</h3>
          <p><strong>Changed on:</strong> <%= @change_time %></p>
          <p><strong>App:</strong> <%= @app_name %></p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Email Comparison -->
        <div class="email-comparison">
          <div class="old-email">
            <strong>Old Email</strong><br>
            <%= @old_email %>
          </div>
          <div class="arrow">→</div>
          <div class="new-email">
            <strong>New Email</strong><br>
            <%= @user.email_address %>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Action Required -->
        <div class="action-required">
          <h3>Didn't make this change?</h3>
          <p>If you didn't change your email address, please contact us immediately at <a href="https://task-days.com/contact" style="color: #721c24;">support@task-days.com</a>.</p>
          <p>This could indicate unauthorized access to your account, and we'll help you secure it right away.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- What This Means -->
        <div class="message">
          <h3 style="color: #333333; margin-bottom: 15px;">What this means:</h3>
          <ul style="color: #555555; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>All future emails from <%= @app_name %> will be sent to your new email address</li>
            <li>You'll need to use your new email address to log in to your account</li>
            <li>Your account data and settings remain unchanged</li>
            <li>If you have the app downloaded, you may need to log in again with your new email</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Support Section -->
        <div class="support-info">
          <h3>Need Help?</h3>
          <p>If you have any questions about this change or need assistance with your account, please contact us at <a href="https://task-days.com/contact">support@task-days.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
          <p>Thank you for keeping your <%= @app_name %> account information up to date!</p>
          
          <p>Best regards,<br>
          The <%= @app_name %> Team</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p><strong><%= @app_name %></strong> - Your personal productivity companion</p>
        <p>This notification was sent to <%= @old_email %> (your old email address).</p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://task-days.com/contact">Contact Support</a> | 
          <a href="https://task-days.com">Visit Website</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
